Attribution and provenance
==========================

This repository is a macOS IOKit port of the FreeBSD Mellanox driver.  The
porting base is vendored verbatim under vendor/freebsd-src/ -- 41 files, all
carrying the dual GPL-2.0 / OpenIB.org BSD header, and those files are not
modified.

This project takes the OpenIB.org BSD branch, which permits redistribution in
source and binary form provided the copyright notice, the list of conditions
and the disclaimer are retained.  That is why this file exists: under the BSD
branch, BINARY redistribution must reproduce the notices in the accompanying
material, so a binary release without this file would not satisfy the license.

